Title: Interval censored multistate hazard models 
Description: Fit multi-state hazard (MSH) for data that is interval censored.
This includes both simple interval censoring as well as multi-state hidden
Markov models (HMM).
These methods are complimentary to the parallel method for MSH found in the
survival package, e.g., non-parametric Aalen-Johansen curves and MSH models 
fit with coxph.  The user interface in particular has been made similar.
Package: icmsh
Version: 2.0-1
Depends: survival, Matrix, R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:  parallel, mvtnorm, quadprog
Suggests: msm, knitr
Lazyload: Yes
LazyData: Yes
VignetteBuilder: knitr
